      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A stored procedure called from ADO.NET.\nWith \"SUM (CASE WHEN)\" for aggregation.\nFed to template with \".SetDataSource\".\nEverything ran by single SQL w/o overhead.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A stored procedure called from ADO.NET.\nWith \"SUM (CASE WHEN)\" for aggregation.\nFed to template with \".SetDataSource\".\nEverything ran by single SQL w/o overhead.",
